Load a file with a very long name and open the button-3 menu, exercising
genmenu3's name-width and middle-truncation rendering.

-- filename --
this_is_a_very_long_file_name_that_exceeds_sixty_four_characters_for_truncation.txt
-- input --
move 300 8
button 4
move 560 8
button 0
move 100 10
button 1
button 0
-- waitframes --
29 29 50 53 54 54 54 54
-- drawops --
JIqbbAbddbbbbdbbbbdbbbYbilbbd{5}bbd{30}bbdbbcl{25}bd{6}bddsdsdsdsdsdsdsddsdddsdc
